---
title: "Dreeve Sticker Map | Dreeve"
description: "Explore the world map of Dreeve stickers. Every pin is a free Dreeve sticker someone stuck somewhere on a ride, run or workout."
canonical: "https://dreeve.app/sticker-map"
robots: "noindex, follow"
ogTitle: "Dreeve stickers around the globe"
ogDescription: "Every pin is a Dreeve sticker someone stuck somewhere on a ride, run or workout."
twitterTitle: "Dreeve stickers around the globe"
twitterDescription: "Every pin is a Dreeve sticker someone stuck somewhere on a ride, run or workout."
twitterImage: "https://dreeve.app/assets/og-image.png"
bodyClass: "h-dvh flex flex-col"
# Soft launch behind the sticker-map feature flag: keep it out of the sitemap.
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}

{% block content %}

<main class="relative flex-1 min-h-0">
    <h1 class="sr-only">Dreeve sticker map</h1>
    <div id="sticker-map" class="sticker-map sticker-map--full" data-deep-links aria-label="World map of Dreeve stickers">
        <p class="sticker-map-placeholder">Loading map…</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sticker-map-card text-center">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">
            <span class="text-strava-orange">{{ stickers | length }}</span> stickers around the globe
        </p>
        <a href="/stickers?feature=sticker-map" class="btn btn-primary mt-3 px-4 py-2">Get your sticker</a>
    </div>
</main>
{% endblock %}

{% block footer %}{% endblock %}

{% block scripts %}
    <script defer src="assets/js/sticker-map.js?v={{ build.jsVersions.stickerMap }}"></script>
{%- endblock %}
